From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 13:05:38 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy: Add SM6450
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Document the USB3 and DisplayPort combo PHY on SM6450. It is the
SM8350 generation with receiver tuning of its own, so it takes its own
compatible rather than SM8350's as a fallback. Like SM8350's, it has
no power domain.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy.yaml   | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy.yaml
index c8bc512df..a2e2de506 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy.yaml
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ properties:
       - qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-usb43dp-phy
       - qcom,sdm845-qmp-usb3-dp-phy
       - qcom,sm6350-qmp-usb3-dp-phy
+      - qcom,sm6450-qmp-usb3-dp-phy
       - qcom,sm8150-qmp-usb3-dp-phy
       - qcom,sm8250-qmp-usb3-dp-phy
       - qcom,sm8350-qmp-usb3-dp-phy
